---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Outdoor advertising | SEZMOO"
  description="Outdoor has two seconds to land one thought – so we design from the message, not from decoration. We prepare billboards, citylights, banners, mesh,"
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">Outdoor <span style="color:#ffd200">advertising.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">Outdoor has <b>two seconds</b> to land one thought – so we design from the message, not from decoration.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We prepare billboards, citylights, banners, mesh, signage and display material – technically correct and bled for the specific carrier.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Scope</span><strong>OOH · banners · signage</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Scale</span><strong>Large format</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Files</span><strong>To carrier spec</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Consistency</span><strong>360 campaign</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-1920.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-800.webp 800w, /assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/optimized/lcp/captains-club-ext-ab51c70e-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="Captain's Club" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>Captain's Club</b><span>Outdoor / event exposure</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we do</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Large format</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Billboards, citylights, boards and LED screens – designed for viewing distance and contact time.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Billboard</span><span>Citylight</span><span>Advertising board</span><span>LED screen</span><span>Bus stop advertising</span><span>Advertising mural</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>Banners &amp; mesh</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Fence banners, facade mesh, roll-ups and walls – for events, construction sites, developments and premises.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Advertising banner</span><span>Facade mesh</span><span>Roll-up</span><span>Event wall</span><span>Flags</span><span>Fence banners</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Signage &amp; POS</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Signs, light boxes, interior signage and material that supports selling at the point of contact.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Sign and light box</span><span>Building signage</span><span>Interior signage</span><span>Stands and displays</span><span>Stickers and windows</span><span>Vehicle wraps</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Campaign adaptation</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Taking the key visual onto the real sizes and technical specs of each carrier.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Format adaptation</span><span>Print preparation</span><span>Bleed and scale</span><span>Language versions</span><span>Colour control</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>How we work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Message</h3><p>We cut the message to one thought readable on the move.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Design</h3><p>Layout, type and contrast tuned to viewing distance.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Specification</h3><p>We collect sizes, bleeds and printer requirements.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Adaptation</h3><p>Versions for every carrier and format.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Print and install</h3><p>Oversight of production and installation.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/realizacja-kapka/"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/kapka/kapka-baner.jpg" alt="Kapka Cafe – Banner · Venue" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Banner · Venue</span><h3>Kapka Cafe ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-world-of-warships/"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/work/captains-club-int.avif" alt="World of Warships – Display · Interior" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Display · Interior</span><h3>World of Warships ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=foto#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><AssetImage src="/assets/photo/netto-architektura.avif" alt="Netto – Signage · Building" loading="lazy" decoding="async" widths={[400, 720, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, (max-width: 1100px) 40vw, 28vw" quality={72} /></div><span>Signage · Building</span><h3>Netto ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
